<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH DECIN ISSUES CZK 250 MLN 7-YR BOND, 12.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH DECIN ISSUES CZK 250 MLN 7-YR BOND, 12.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The northern Czech city of Decin has issued 250 million crowns in 7-year domestic bonds, with a fixed coupon of 12.5 percent, the arranger of the issued Ceskoslovenska Obchodni Banka said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details of the issue were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
